#chip 12F683, 7
#osc INTOSC

'Change1657 test: the internal-oscillator frequency/chip mismatch message (BadIntFreq) is now
'an Information message, not a Warning - it no longer counts toward the Warning total and
'cannot be promoted to an Error by #option WarningsAsErrors. 7MHz is not one of 12F683's valid
'internal-oscillator speeds.
'Expect: compiles with 0 errors, 0 warnings; the summary prints "Compiler information:" /
'"Information: Internal oscillator clock source does not support the specified frequency...".
'Before this change, the same source produced "A warning has been generated:" / "Warning: ...".

Do
Loop
